Package: fastbursts
Type: Package
Title: Fast Kleinberg Burst Detection
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Joel Yew
Maintainer: Joel Yew <joelyew@utexas.edu>
Description: A performance-optimized implementation of Kleinberg's (2002) burst detection algorithm, utilizing a linear-time dynamic programming approach for efficient analysis of large event sequences.

